<section class="mt-12 prose prose-invert max-w-none">
	<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">How to play Driftaku</h2>
	<p class="text-slate-400">
		Driftaku is a daily logic puzzle for anime fans. Every day, a new "Web" of 50 interconnected nodes is generated. 
		Your mission is to find the path from the starting anime to the target studio or character using shared relationships.
	</p>
	<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 not-prose mt-6">
		<div class="bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
			<h3 class="text-indigo-400 font-bold mb-2">1. Explore the Graph</h3>
			<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Pinch or scroll to zoom into the web. Drag to pan around the connections.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
			<h3 class="text-indigo-400 font-bold mb-2">2. Link Nodes</h3>
			<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Click a node connected to your current position to move forward. Avoid dead ends!</p>
		</div>
		<div class="bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
			<h3 class="text-indigo-400 font-bold mb-2">3. Beat the Clock</h3>
			<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">The faster you connect the path, the higher your score on the global leaderboard.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>